On 03-03-10 05:53, Vandana Vuthoo wrote:
> Hi,
> I need to know how to add diff locale supports in OE, I tried
> IMAGE_LINGAUS but it is not working for me.

If you want to install locales + translations, you need to set
IMAGE_LINGUAS to your liking and add the following to your image recipe:

ROOTFS_POSTPROCESS_COMMAND += 'install_linguas;'

regards,

